      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's highly possible that your department is engaging in discriminatory behavior. To document these incidents and prepare for a potential claim, start keeping a detailed log of all the events, including dates, times, and specific actions taken. Include copies of emails, pay stubs, and menus to provide concrete evidence of the changes. Also, take notes during 1:1 meetings and keep a record of any subsequent rescheduling attempts.",
